window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Megamite threat was just the beginning.</b></p> <p>Zagan is dead, and Tiriden is free from Megamite control. But our victory came with a grim revelation—buried beneath the city were blueprints for a superweapon designed to spread the Megamite infection across the galaxy. And now, it’s in enemy hands.</p> <p>Worse, I’ve learned my sister is working for Nargor, the Megamite Overlord.</p> <p>We’ll need all the help we can get to stop them, even from a former enemy commander and a sharp-tongued wolf-girl thief. My powers are still growing, but will they be enough to take down a weapon that could doom us all?</p> <p><b>I’ll risk everything to protect the ones I love. Even if it kills me.</b></p>"; 
